  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "等于 4 也算达到门槛",
        "en": "Exactly 4 meets the limit"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "数轴上，3 在 4 的左边，电量不够。4 正好达到门槛，5 超过门槛，这两个电量都够。程序用 True 表示真，用 False 表示假。",
        "en": "On the number line, 3 is to the left of 4 and is too low. Exactly 4 meets the limit, and 5 is higher. The program uses True and False for the two possible answers."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "两项都为真才能出发",
        "en": "Both conditions must be true to leave"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "电量判断和安全门各有一个布尔值。and 把两个条件合在一起。电量足够且门开着，芽芽才可以出发。",
        "en": "The charge check and the safety door each have a Boolean value. The word and combines the two conditions. Sprout can leave when the charge is high enough and the door is open."
      }
    }
  ],
